## Summary
Saber Interactive denies using AI (ChatGPT) to replace a writer on their upcoming game Rideshare Stimulator. The denial comes amid concerns about AI replacing human writers in the industry. The game's development continues without confirmation of AI involvement in writing roles.

## Key Points
- Saber Interactive denies replacing a writer with ChatGPT in Rideshare Stimulator
- The game is an upcoming driving title
- Denial addresses concerns over AI replacing human writers in the gaming industry


